71-25/39031423_480940983413392_1285073711481211677_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mX1wPTG30-oQ7kNvwHIoOg5&_nc_oc=AdrGx0twojo99oFBsbEf4w0SU-HL7SDXkfZQp5qIMfTnpOCa0NyZQVLS87MhRXOXxn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFiDzGwSuXS8wwyW2RrlYw0CWP37phenp4b71dr41o8SA&oe=6A9028AE"}, "display_name": "EnvisionVR Design", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Our EnvisionVR app allows you to view your future projects in high-fidelity Virtual Reality.\n\nCreate virtual inspections of your off-the-plan properties in VR. You can talk to buyers in real-time, explain what they are seeing and navigate them throughout the property.\n\nOff-the-plan properties have been sold in the same way for years with brochures, high-quality photo renders, and stylish display suites. Whilst they do the trick, here at EnvisionVR we like to take things to the next level. That's why we created our world-first EnvisionVR app which allows you to view your future project in high-fidelity Virtual Reality and Augmented Reality using a VR headset or smart device. Our VR experiences are completely mobile, multi-person and collaborative coupled with an easy- to-use interface that will enhance your sales process.", "short_description": "Our EnvisionVR app allows you to view your future projects in high-fidelity Virtual Reality.\n\nCreate virtual inspections of your off-the-plan properties in VR. You can talk to buyers in real-time, explain what they are seeing and navigate them throughout the property."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://envisionvr.net/app-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://envisionvr.net/app-terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Envision VR Pty Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://envisionvr.net/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id":